# Used only by `npm run build:public` (26 Nov, deployment: laptop + Cloudflare Tunnel, docs/deploy/tunnel.md).
# The app calls the API at /api on its own address; `npm run serve:public` (vite preview) passes /api to the backend.
# In a file, not on the command line: Git Bash turns a value starting with "/" into a Windows path.
VITE_API_URL=/api
